    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a roguelite creature survival game. Hatch your water dragon and gain xp to see how many days you can survive on the randomly generated planet. Build a house with a forcefield, build campfires and grow plant life. Earn evolution gems to evolve your dragon. Fight with your chosen abilities in a unique card battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive against laser robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/69e097327054c9e38030afbb5f37e7f9.poster.avif?t=1742131443\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/69e097327054c9e38030afbb5f37e7f9.webm?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/69e097327054c9e38030afbb5f37e7f9.mp4?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cull the population of the blue monster rats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/1dc91fbc85f751ebe3bca355be97e2a9.poster.avif?t=1742131443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/1dc91fbc85f751ebe3bca355be97e2a9.webm?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/1dc91fbc85f751ebe3bca355be97e2a9.mp4?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a roguelite creature survival game. Hatch your water dragon and gain xp to see how many days you can survive on the randomly generated planet. Build a house with a forcefield, build campfires and grow plant life. Earn evolution gems to evolve your dragon. Fight with your chosen abilities in a unique card battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive against laser robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/69e097327054c9e38030afbb5f37e7f9.poster.avif?t=1742131443\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/69e097327054c9e38030afbb5f37e7f9.webm?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/69e097327054c9e38030afbb5f37e7f9.mp4?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cull the population of the blue monster rats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/1dc91fbc85f751ebe3bca355be97e2a9.poster.avif?t=1742131443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/1dc91fbc85f751ebe3bca355be97e2a9.webm?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197370/extras/1dc91fbc85f751ebe3bca355be97e2a9.mp4?t=1742131443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
